-//   - the names in namedKeys ("enter", "esc", "shift+tab", "pgdown", "f5"...);
+//   - the names in namedKeys ("enter", "esc", "pgdown", "f5"...);
+//   - "shift+tab", computed as the tab key with the shift modifier;
